Maintainer: litchi-gh <https://github.com/litchi-gh>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Suggests: cups-client
Homepage: https://github.com/litchi-gh/pc-e500_emulator_pockecom
Description: SHARP PC-E500 series pocket computer emulator
 Emulates the PC-E500, PC-E500S, PC-E550, PC-1480U, PC-1490U, PC-E650 and
 PC-U6000 with the CE-140F drive and the CE-126P printer. A ROM dumped from
 your own machine is needed. Includes the pokecom command line and MCP server.
